description: Keep PRs story-scoped; no drive-bys or speculative code
alwaysApply: true
---

# Story-scoped changes

- One user story (or one EPIC-xx-US-xx theme) per branch/PR. Do not bundle unrelated stories.
- Change only files needed for the acceptance criteria. No drive-by refactors, renames, or cleanup outside the story.
- No speculative abstractions, "future-proof" layers, or unused helpers/libraries.
- If scope creeps, stop and ask before expanding.
